# research-ledger.jsonl is COMMITTED and deliberately absent from this list.
# It is the canonical ledger: one line per file entry, sorted by path. While the
# pretty JSON below was the only copy, it was gitignored, so the same command at
# the same commit measured one figure on the one laptop that held it and a flat
# zero on every clean checkout.
#
